 "scope_note": "Title page (read via the blank verso's show-through, leaf 8, mirrored and contrast-lifted): 'TROW BUSINESS DIRECTORY OF THE BOROUGHS OF MANHATTAN AND THE BRONX ... ARRANGED UNDER BUSINESS CLASSIFICATIONS ... 1913, VOLUME LXVI'. ALL THREE PARTS of the 1913 set are the Trow BUSINESS directory, Vol. LXVI -- firms, not residents -- despite IA titling every part 'Trow's general directory of the boroughs of Manhattan and Bronx'. The identifier `trowsgeneraldir...` is equally misleading. Confirmed from the printed title pages, 2026-09-22.",
